      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As you can no doubt see, I am an artist!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300200079006F0075002000630061006E0020006E006F00200064006F0075006200740020007300650065002C0020004900200061006D00200061006E00200061007200740069007300740021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I came here to sketch the scenery for a piece that\nwill no doubt take first place in my next contest...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But behold!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020006200650068006F006C00640021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Those awful brambles are obscuring my view of\nthe fountain! They’re ruining the scene!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alas, my Pokémon have no means of removing\nthis vexing vegetation...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C00610073002C0020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000680061007600650020006E006F0020006D00650061006E00730020006F0066002000720065006D006F00760069006E0067000A007400680069007300200076006500780069006E0067002000760065006700650074006100740069006F006E002E002E002E001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aha! A bolt of inspiration strikes! Perhaps burning\nthe brambles might do the trick?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, I beg you!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThose brambles must be gone if I am to complete\nmy piece. Have your Pokémon burn them away!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Those brambles are ruining my view of the\nfountain. Please, have your Pokémon burn them!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
