      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Finally—FINALLY—I can resume sketching.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006E0061006C006C0079201400460049004E0041004C004C005920140049002000630061006E00200072006500730075006D006500200073006B00650074006300680069006E0067002E001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I admit that I remain puzzled, though. How could\nso many brambles have appeared so suddenly?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look! It’s a Phantump! Could it be that this\nPokémon was sabotaging me?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Phan-ta-tump.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000680061006E002D00740061002D00740075006D0070002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, cruel Pokémon! Why must you torment me\nso, when I am already pressed for time?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aha! Inspiration strikes yet again!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680061002100200049006E0073007000690072006100740069006F006E00200073007400720069006B00650073002000790065007400200061006700610069006E0021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Drawing Phantump alongside the fountain would\nbe a perfect representation of life in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYour role is decided, Phantump. You shall be my\nmodel—my muse!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 164
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T-tump?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054002D00740075006D0070003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ll create a masterpiece—the painting of our\nera, destined for the Lumiose Museum’s halls!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDon’t you dare move from that spot, Phantump!\nStay put until my work is done!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Phaaannn...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500068006100610061006E006E006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now we’re sure to take first place in the\nupcoming contest. I can’t thank you enough!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
